cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HydroSense ESP32-C3 in research or a project, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "HydroSense ESP32-C3 Sensor Node"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Mondal"
    given-names: "Rupam"

abstract: >-
  HydroSense ESP32-C3 is an embedded sensing and edge-processing
  firmware component for hydroponic environmental and reservoir
  monitoring. It integrates DHT22, DS18B20, HC-SR04 and SH1106
  hardware with sensor validation, ultrasonic correction, robust
  filtering, reservoir calibration, environmental analytics,
  sensor-health evaluation, data-quality scoring, local OLED
  presentation and versioned CRC-protected BLE telemetry.

keywords:
  - HydroSense
  - ESP32-C3
  - hydroponics
  - embedded systems
  - Internet of Things
  - environmental monitoring
  - reservoir monitoring
  - Bluetooth Low Energy
  - PlatformIO
  - sensor fusion

license: MIT
